    }
  ],
  "translation": "Twalaɣ am ini n ḥacmal, am umdi n timest, ⟨axxam-is⟩ s lḥawẓa; seg umdi n tunft-is ar s afella, seg umdi n tunft-is ar s adda, twalaɣ am umdi n timest, tella tafat i-s s lḥawẓa.",
